1
00:00:00,621 --> 00:00:04,121
(Penny:)But also how incredibly
happy you make me.

2
00:00:05,459 --> 00:00:07,209
(Penny:)Thank you for marrying me.

3
00:00:07,211 --> 00:00:09,041
(Penny:)Hopefully for the last time.

4
00:00:12,015 --> 00:00:13,765
(Sceme:)Penny...

5
00:00:13,767 --> 00:00:17,437
(Leonard:)as a scientist, my job is to
figure out why things happen.

6
00:00:17,437 --> 00:00:20,637
(Leonard:)But I don't think
I'll ever understand

7
00:00:20,641 --> 00:00:25,141
(Leonard:)how someone like me could get
to be with someone like you.

8
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:29,230
(Leonard:)You know... maybe... I don't
need to understand it,

9
00:00:29,233 --> 00:00:30,313
I just need to be grateful.

10
00:00:30,317 --> 00:00:31,487
I love you, Penny.

11
00:00:31,485 --> 00:00:33,285
(Penny:)Oh...

12
00:00:34,905 --> 00:00:37,875
(Bernadette:)Anybody have anything snarky
to say about that?

13
00:00:39,910 --> 00:00:41,960
(Bernadette:)Didn't think so.

14
00:00:42,913 --> 00:00:44,543
(Alfred:)I'd like to say something.

15
00:00:45,749 --> 00:00:48,379
(Alfred:)Beverly, I know that
we don't bring out

16
00:00:48,385 --> 00:00:49,755
(Alfred:)the best in each other.

17
00:00:49,753 --> 00:00:53,923
But something wonderful did
come from our relationship:

18
00:00:53,924 --> 00:00:55,224
that young man right there.

19
00:00:56,260 --> 00:01:00,020
(Beverley:)I couldn't agree more.

